      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the Elder Abu\u02bel-Mun\u0101 b. \u02bfImr\u0101n&nbsp; <i>(may his) R(ock) pr(otect him)</i> [[eight]] // six // 1/2</li>\n<li>Abu\u02bel-\u1e24asan the preparer/seller of potions three dirhems</li>\n<li>the Elder Ab\u016b Is\u1e25aq the preparer/seller of potions 1 1/2 dirhems</li>\n<li>the Elder Avraham the teacher from al-Ma\u1e25all\u0101 1 3/4 dirhems</li>\n<li>the Kohen Abu\u02bel-Faraj the clothier six [[less 1/4]]</li>\n<li>the father, <i>(may God) make his honor permanent</i> [[2 dirhems exactly]]</li>\n<li>the tailor Fa\u1e0dl (Al)l\u0101h [[1 dirhem exactly]]</li>\n<li>the seller of chickens Fa\u1e0dl (Al)l\u0101h [[1 1/2 dirhems]]</li>\n<li>another Fa\u1e0dl (Al)l\u0101h 1/2 dirhem</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r b. al-Daj\u0101j\u012b (son of the seller of chickens) 3/8</li>\n<li>Man\u1e63\u016br b. Bish\u0101r [[1/4]] 1/8 dirhem</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfq\u016bb the seller (of food stuff) 3/8</li>\n<li>Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal in the Great Market [[3/4]]</li>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; total</li>\n<li>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26</li>\n<li>paid up on Friday</li>\n<li>Mun\u0101 the seller of chickens [. . .</li>\n<li>...</li></ol>\n",
